{"unit_id":"zcr-133__dsh-follow-edits#card-1","repo":"zcr-133/dsh-follow-edits","commit":"2f6bb66a7589380ea872c4fa1476ae568bfe6c24","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-follow-edits 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的实时编辑跟随插件。它在 host 侧监听成功的文件编辑并记录路径、行号和新旧文本，再通过会话投影传给浏览器端；浏览器随即打开右侧 Sidebar 文档预览并跳到改动位置。对于 create、write 和插入操作可直接确定行号，对于替换或删除会在编辑前查找旧文本定位；预览以黄色标出新增或改动行、红色显示被删内容。Shell 写入的文件也可自动打开，但不跳行或高亮。适合希望实时查看 agent 改动的 DSH 网页开发场景；安装需使用 Plugin Manager。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:197-244","index.js:246-285","client.js:220-259","client.js:286-299"]}
{"unit_id":"zcr-133__dsh-follow-edits#card-2","repo":"zcr-133/dsh-follow-edits","commit":"2f6bb66a7589380ea872c4fa1476ae568bfe6c24","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-follow-edits follows edits in DSH web. It opens each changed file in the right Sidebar and jumps to the edited line. Added or changed lines are highlighted yellow; deleted text appears red. Shell-written files open without line jumps or highlighting. Install through Plugin Manager.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:197-244","index.js:246-285","client.js:220-259","client.js:286-299"]}
