{"unit_id":"zcr-133__dsh-follow-edits#caveat-1","repo":"zcr-133/dsh-follow-edits","commit":"2f6bb66a7589380ea872c4fa1476ae568bfe6c24","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-follow-edits 使用 priority 为 extension 的自定义文本预览渲染器接管代码预览；这会替代内置代码渲染器，默认失去其 Shiki 语法高亮。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:25-34","client.js:286-299"]}
{"unit_id":"zcr-133__dsh-follow-edits#caveat-2","repo":"zcr-133/dsh-follow-edits","commit":"2f6bb66a7589380ea872c4fa1476ae568bfe6c24","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-follow-edits 的 Shell 文件跟随依赖支持递归监听的 node:fs.watch；代码注明 Linux 等不支持该选项的平台会跳过这一路径，且 Shell 变更只打开文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:24-29","index.js:149-171"]}
